WEBVTT

00:01.160 --> 00:02.720
Xie Ruolan pleaded through the night to see Eunuch Wen. Yet though Wen Xian agreed in words, he repeatedly delayed...

00:02.800 --> 00:05.467
Eunuch Wen is a favorite of His Majesty

00:05.560 --> 00:06.560
Our Xie family

00:06.640 --> 00:08.120
Has some friendship with him

00:08.200 --> 00:09.720
I'll ask the old gentleman for help

00:09.800 --> 00:11.800
To buy the prince some time

